OL,3,GNEWSA'Chaos' as roadworks traffic cuts
OL,4,Athrough hamlet
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a south Oxfordshire hamlet
OL,7,Fhave said traffic trying to avoid
OL,8,Froadworks has turned their lives
OL,9,F"upside down".
OL,11,FA closure on the A4074 at Mapledurham
OL,12,Fover the last two weeks has seen
OL,13,Farticulated lorries and heavy traffic
OL,14,Fcutting through its tight roads.
OL,16,FSNG, which is carrying out the
OL,17,Femergency gas main repair work, said it
OL,18,Fwas aware some motorists were not
OL,19,Ffollowing the official diversion.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
